{"nodes": [{"id": "readme", "label": "README: Kleva - Agentes de cobranza (demo)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_callengine_port", "label": "CallEngine port (swappable call emulation)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Calls are a random emulation with injectable seed behind a CallEngine port so an LLM engine can replace it later without touching place_call, the dispatcher, the API or the frontend."}, {"id": "readme_call_emulation_model", "label": "Call emulation model (ANSWER_RATE 0.65, style-dependent promise)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L39", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Answering does not depend on negotiation style (style doesn't make someone pick up). If answered, outcome depends on style profile; debtors >90 days overdue get -0.15 promise probability. Emulation never touches the balance."}, {"id": "readme_negotiation_style_profiles", "label": "Negotiation style profiles (suave / flexible / rigido)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L44", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Suave: installment plan, P(promise)=0.70, 15-30 days, 100% balance. Flexible: discount for payment, 0.55, 7-15 days, balance minus 10-30%. Rigido: full immediate payment, 0.40, 1-5 days, 100% balance."}, {"id": "readme_call_outcomes", "label": "Call outcomes (no answer / promise in N days / refuses)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_debtor_eligibility_rule", "label": "Debtor eligibility rule (country, product, min days overdue, next_contact_at)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L50", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Eligible if country and product match, days_overdue >= min_days_overdue and next_contact_at is null or past; oldest debt first, then largest."}, {"id": "readme_requeue_policy", "label": "Post-call requeue policy via next_contact_at", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L52", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No answer -> 30 min; refuses -> 7 days; promise -> one day after promised date. A single next_contact_at column captures retry, cooldown and promise to keep the eligibility query simple."}, {"id": "readme_single_dispatcher", "label": "Single asyncio dispatcher loop (one call per active agent per tick)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L62", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Agent state lives in the DB and only one dispatcher runs, so it survives restarts and has no races; uvicorn runs without --workers because N workers would mean N dispatchers. Calls are sequential with one commit per call so two agents can't call the same debtor. 'Llamar ahora' reuses place_call."}, {"id": "readme_layered_architecture", "label": "Layered architecture api -> services -> crud -> models", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L68", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Thin routers testable via HTTP; SQL lives only in crud/."}, {"id": "readme_immutable_snapshots", "label": "Immutable snapshots passed to CallEngine (not ORM models)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L69", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Engine cannot touch the DB, is testable without a session, and an LLM engine would receive exactly the same input."}, {"id": "readme_injected_rng_and_clock", "label": "Injected random.Random and clock (get_call_engine, get_clock)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L70", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deterministic tests; with SIMULATION_SEED the demo is reproducible."}, {"id": "readme_enums_as_varchar", "label": "Enums stored as VARCHAR (native_enum=False)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Adding a value does not require ALTER TYPE and works the same on the SQLite used in tests."}, {"id": "readme_utc_datetime_decision", "label": "UTCDateTime TypeDecorator decision", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L75", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Postgres returns tz-aware datetimes and SQLite does not; the app always sees UTC-aware values."}, {"id": "readme_agent_soft_delete", "label": "Agent soft delete, 409 if active", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L76", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Preserves call history."}, {"id": "readme_money_as_decimal", "label": "Money as Numeric/Decimal, string in JSON", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L78", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Never use float for amounts."}, {"id": "readme_auth_design", "label": "Auth: OAuth2 password + JWT HS256 + Argon2id, constant-time login", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "FastAPI/Swagger standard; constant message and timing on login so existing emails are not revealed. No public user registration: users come from the seed."}, {"id": "readme_openapi_contract", "label": "Frontend types generated from OpenAPI, labels from /catalogs", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L80", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Backend is the single source of contracts and enums."}, {"id": "readme_dependency_pins", "label": "Version pins: SQLAlchemy <2.1, TypeScript 5.x", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L82", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "opentelemetry-instrumentation-sqlalchemy does not instrument SQLAlchemy 2.1 yet; openapi-typescript uses the TS 5 compiler API."}, {"id": "readme_port_isolation", "label": "Non-default host ports and kleva_* container names", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L26", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Avoid default ports (5432, 8000, 3000, 9090) so the stack coexists with other local stacks; all configurable via .env."}, {"id": "readme_seed_data", "label": "Seed demo data (admin user, 520 debtors, 3 paused agents)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L28", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_test_strategy", "label": "Test strategy (HTTP E2E, engine unit tests, direct tick())", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L101", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "FixedOutcomeEngine and FrozenClock test persistence/retry rules without waiting; engine tests check seed reproducibility and rigido < flexible < suave promise rates; dispatcher tested by calling tick() directly without sleep or background task."}, {"id": "readme_observability", "label": "Observability stack (Prometheus, Loki+Alloy, Tempo+OpenTelemetry, Grafana)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L113", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_kleva_calls_total", "label": "kleva_calls_total{outcome,style,country} metric", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L115", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_trace_log_correlation", "label": "Log <-> trace correlation via trace_id", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L118", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_dashboard_as_code", "label": "Grafana dashboard generated as code (build_dashboard.py)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L119", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "To change the dashboard, edit the script, not the UI."}, {"id": "readme_llm_call_engine", "label": "LLMCallEngine (planned AI replacement)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L153", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Same signature async run(agent: AgentSnapshot, debtor: DebtorSnapshot) -> CallResult, returns engine='llm', selected in lifespan."}], "edges": [{"source": "readme", "target": "readme_callengine_port", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L6", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_callengine_port", "target": "app_services_call_engine_base_callengine", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence